WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.550
Welcome to Shoebox. Here's how to set it up.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:10.810
In any app, tap Share, then Shoebox. If it's not in the row, swipe to the end, tap More, and add it.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.450
Say why you're keeping it. A day, like Monday or the weekend, brings it back then.

4
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.850
You can also keep things right in the app, with + New.

5
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.700
Pick when your posts come out each morning, and turn on the one daily notification.

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.870
Then three moves.

7
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.110
Flick up for the next one.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.980
Pull down when you're done.

9
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.780
Tap to open.

10
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.750
Everything waits in your Shoebox. Search finds anything, even what you put away.

11
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.870
Forwarding email comes with Shoebox Plus. You'll find it in Settings.

12
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.170
Questions? Write to support@inmyshoebox.com.
